        'An EM wave travels along +x with E = E₀ sin(kx − ωt) ĵ. Write the corresponding B field, state its direction, and verify E×B points along propagation. Also compute c from μ₀ and ε₀ (in m/s, e.g. 2.998e8).',
      answer: '2.998e8',
