        'B = B₀ sin(kx − ωt) k̂ (along z). ĵ × k̂ = î, so E×B is along +x — propagation direction. c = 1/√(μ₀ε₀) ≈ 2.998×10⁸ m/s.',
      hint: 'B must be along z so E, B, c form a right-handed triad. c = 1/√(μ₀ε₀).',
    },
