        'A student writes the EM wave equation as ∇²E = (1/v²)∂²E/∂t² with v = √(μ₀ε₀) and claims E and B are 90° out of phase. Evaluate BOTH parts: is the speed correct? is the phase correct? Answer "both wrong", "speed wrong only", "phase wrong only", or "both correct".',
      answer: 'both wrong',
